      "content": "i don't know if i can \"just accept it.\" everything i built is gone. i feel like if i stay, they just have to watch my life slowly fall apart and become a constant reminder of what i lost. wouldn't it be easier for them if they just kept the memory of who i used to be? like, if i just... disappeared, the version of me they love stays perfect. i can't stand the idea of being a burden to them forever.",
